{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10291120","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10291120","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1029112001:1":{"text":"女神のご加護があらんことを。何かご用ですかな？","source_cn":"愿女神庇佑您。诸位有什么事吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x226B5B3698651D26","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029112002:1":{"text":"修道者さん、お聞きしたいことがあるんです……この近くで変な言葉遣いの女の子を見かけませんでしたか？","source_cn":"修士大人，我们想要和你打听一件重要的事……你有没有在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D4C335F01F19BC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029112003:1":{"text":"変な言葉遣い……ああ！「サレオス」とか「深淵」とか「眷族」といった妙な言葉を喋る女の子ですかな？","source_cn":"胡言乱语……啊！那个一直说什么“赛利欧斯”“深渊”“眷...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE397B1649F62FB7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1029112003":{"text":"変な言葉遣い……ああ！「サレオス」とか「深淵」とか「眷族」といった妙な言葉を喋る女の子ですかな？","source_cn":"胡言乱语……啊！那个一直说什么“赛利欧斯”“深渊”“眷属”之类奇怪词汇的小女孩吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE397B1649F62FB7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029112004:1":{"text":"つい先ほどここに来ていましたよ。ブツブツと邪悪な単語を並べ立てていましたが、おかしな気配は感じませんでしたな。","source_cn":"就在不久之前，她出现在了这里。虽然口中念念有词着邪恶的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1925D2226BC0A414","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_i